        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0605R, Traditional Provence Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design and even easier installation, the Provence Leverset, made by Weslock, will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. It has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This Traditionale Collection Provence Lever is available in dummy, passage, privacy and an ANSI grade 2 rated keyed entry function. It features adjustable latches for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches and is available for backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classic lever is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction as well as lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Traditionale Collection Provence Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The keyed entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>Fully <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Panic-proof keyed entry and privacy functions means that one turn of interior lever unlocks and opens door.</li>\r\n<li>Locksets have pre-installed installation screws, which are concealed behind a snap-on rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Removable lever prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li>All brass lever and rosette.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime PVD finish on exterior polished brass.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditionale Collection Provence Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose: Round</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-12\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock. Door lever operates latch from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking for privacy. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy lock; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. Locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and push button on interior rose. Turning inside lever will release lock and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditionale Collection Provence Lever, Weslock 0605R",
                "description": "Traditionale Collection Provence Lever - Simple in design and even easier installation, the Provence Leverset, made by Weslock, will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. It has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This Traditionale Collection Provence Lever is available in dummy, passage, privacy and an ANSI grade 2 rated keyed entry function. It features adjustable latches for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches and is available for backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
